LIMIT 3 BY: every row of a 3-row group survives
300000	300000	0	299999
LIMIT 5 BY: a limit above the group size keeps the group whole
300000	300000
LIMIT 2 BY: exactly two rows per key, and each row belongs to its key
200000	100000	200000	0
LIMIT 2 BY: no group comes back short or long
2	2	100000
LIMIT 2 OFFSET 1 BY: the offset skips one row per group, not one row overall
2	2	100000	200000
LIMIT 1 BY: one row per key
100000	100000	0
the spilled LIMIT 3 BY result is exactly the input
0
